# Deployment Protocol

- **`dev`:** Staging / testing environment (`dev.buddget.app`).
- **`main`:** Production (`buddget.app` / primary Vercel production branch).

## Branch rules

- **No feature branches.** Work on `dev`.
- **Auto-merge mode:** every push to `dev` also goes to `main` (the same commit, no PR). This is the rule in `CLAUDE.md`; do not hold a push back for an extra confirmation.

## Validation before any push

Run `npm run verify` (lint, types, tests in Cairo and New York, migration check, dependency audit, production build with dummy Supabase env). It must pass before pushing to `dev`/`main`. GitHub Actions is not relied on.

## Push workflow

1. Commit on `dev`: `git push origin dev`.
2. Push the same commit to production: `git push origin HEAD:main`.
3. Confirm it landed: `git log origin/main -1`.

Native builds (TestFlight, Drive APK) run only when the user asks for them, locally, through `scripts/native-release.sh`.
